Hi,

Here we got problem with CDMA dongle (CDMA2000/EVDO/HSIA), in Windows diale=
r we can select the network type as following: Netconnect +, High speed 1x =
or HYBRID.
I assume Netconnect+ stands for CDMA2000, and High Speed 1x stands for CDMA=
 EVFDO 1x.

And the dialer will show in an icon to tell what mode is select or can be s=
upported currently. If select an unsupported type, it could fail to connect=
 to the network.

But when trying to modify the radio access technology in ofono, I cannot se=
e the according options, what is there is GSM, UMTS, ANY, etc.
Could anybody tell me how to issue the script set-tech-reference to force o=
fono to work in desired network type?

